{"page":207,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:123","surah":9,"ayah":123,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ قَـٰتِلُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ يَلُونَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْكُفَّارِ وَلْيَجِدُوا۟ فِيكُمْ غِلْظَةً ۚ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ مَعَ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, fight the disbelievers near you and let them find you standing firm: be aware that God is with those who are mindful of Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَـٰتِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fight","transliteration":"qātilū","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَلُونَكُم","en_gloss":"(are) close to you","transliteration":"yalūnakum","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْكُفَّارِ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kufāri","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلْيَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"and let them find","transliteration":"walyajidū","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"in you","transliteration":"fīkum","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غِلْظَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"harshness","transliteration":"ghil'ẓatan","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"(is) with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en_gloss":"those who fear (Him)","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","verse_key":"9:123"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٢٣","en_gloss":"(123)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:123"}]},{"verse_key":"9:124","surah":9,"ayah":124,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا مَآ أُنزِلَتْ سُورَةٌ فَمِنْهُم مَّن يَقُولُ أَيُّكُمْ زَادَتْهُ هَـٰذِهِۦٓ إِيمَـٰنًا ۚ فَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ فَزَادَتْهُمْ إِيمَـٰنًا وَهُمْ يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When a sura is revealed, some [hypocrites] say, ‘Have any of you been strengthened in faith by it?’ It certainly does strengthen the faith of those who believe and they rejoice,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And whenever","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"And whenever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُنزِلَتْ","en_gloss":"is revealed","transliteration":"unzilat","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُورَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Surah","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"famin'hum","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are some) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيُّكُمْ","en_gloss":"Which of you","transliteration":"ayyukum","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":9,"ar":"زَادَتْهُ","en_gloss":"(has) increased [it]","transliteration":"zādathu","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"(by) this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(in) faith","transliteration":"īmānan","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"As for","transliteration":"fa-ammā","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَزَادَتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"then it has increased them","transliteration":"fazādathum","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) faith","transliteration":"īmānan","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","en_gloss":"rejoice","transliteration":"yastabshirūna","verse_key":"9:124"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٢٤","en_gloss":"(124)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:124"}]},{"verse_key":"9:125","surah":9,"ayah":125,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا ٱلَّذِينَ فِى قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٌ فَزَادَتْهُمْ رِجْسًا إِلَىٰ رِجْسِهِمْ وَمَاتُوا۟ وَهُمْ كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but, as for the perverse at heart, each new sura adds further to their perversity. They die disbelieving.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَمَّا","en_gloss":"But as for","transliteration":"wa-ammā","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِم","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَّرَضٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a disease","transliteration":"maraḍun","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَزَادَتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"(it) increases them","transliteration":"fazādathum","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رِجْسًا","en_gloss":"(in) evil","transliteration":"rij'san","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رِجْسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their evil","transliteration":"rij'sihim","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they die","transliteration":"wamātū","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":12,"ar":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) disbelievers","transliteration":"kāfirūna","verse_key":"9:125"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٢٥","en_gloss":"(125)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:125"}]},{"verse_key":"9:126","surah":9,"ayah":126,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَا يَرَوْنَ أَنَّهُمْ يُفْتَنُونَ فِى كُلِّ عَامٍ مَّرَّةً أَوْ مَرَّتَيْنِ ثُمَّ لَا يَتُوبُونَ وَلَا هُمْ يَذَّكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Can they not see that they are afflicted once or twice a year? Yet they neither repent nor take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَا","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalā","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْنَ","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yarawna","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُفْتَنُونَ","en_gloss":"are tried","transliteration":"yuf'tanūna","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَامٍۢ","en_gloss":"year","transliteration":"ʿāmin","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّرَّةً","en_gloss":"once","transliteration":"marratan","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَرَّتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"twice","transliteration":"marratayni","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Yet","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَتُوبُونَ","en_gloss":"they turn (in repentance)","transliteration":"yatūbūna","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَذَّكَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"pay heed","transliteration":"yadhakkarūna","verse_key":"9:126"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٢٦","en_gloss":"(126)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:126"}]},{"verse_key":"9:127","surah":9,"ayah":127,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا مَآ أُنزِلَتْ سُورَةٌ نَّظَرَ بَعْضُهُمْ إِلَىٰ بَعْضٍ هَلْ يَرَىٰكُم مِّنْ أَحَدٍ ثُمَّ ٱنصَرَفُوا۟ ۚ صَرَفَ ٱللَّهُ قُلُوبَهُم بِأَنَّهُمْ قَوْمٌ لَّا يَفْقَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Whenever a sura is revealed, they look at each other and say, ‘Is anyone watching you?’ and then they turn away- God has turned their hearts away because they are people who do not use their reason.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And whenever","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"And whenever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُنزِلَتْ","en_gloss":"is revealed","transliteration":"unzilat","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":4,"ar":"سُورَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Surah","transliteration":"sūratun","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَّظَرَ","en_gloss":"look","transliteration":"naẓara","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْضُهُمْ","en_gloss":"some of them","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَعْضٍ","en_gloss":"others","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"Does","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَرَىٰكُم","en_gloss":"see you","transliteration":"yarākum","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَحَدٍۢ","en_gloss":"one","transliteration":"aḥadin","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱنصَرَفُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they turn away","transliteration":"inṣarafū","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":15,"ar":"صَرَفَ","en_gloss":"Allah has turned away","transliteration":"ṣarafa","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has turned away","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قُلُوبَهُم","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbahum","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"because they","transliteration":"bi-annahum","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":19,"ar":"قَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a people","transliteration":"qawmun","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"they understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"9:127"},{"pos":22,"ar":"١٢٧","en_gloss":"(127)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:127"}]},{"verse_key":"9:128","surah":9,"ayah":128,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ جَآءَكُمْ رَسُولٌ مِّنْ أَنفُسِكُمْ عَزِيزٌ عَلَيْهِ مَا عَنِتُّمْ حَرِيصٌ عَلَيْكُم بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ رَءُوفٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"A Messenger has come to you from among yourselves. Your suffering distresses him: he is deeply concerned for you and full of kindness and mercy towards the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(has) come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَسُولٌۭ","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlun","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","en_gloss":"yourselves","transliteration":"anfusikum","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَزِيزٌ","en_gloss":"Grievous","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَنِتُّمْ","en_gloss":"you suffer","transliteration":"ʿanittum","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَرِيصٌ","en_gloss":"(he is) concerned","transliteration":"ḥarīṣun","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْكُم","en_gloss":"over you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"9:128"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِ